<title>JAPAN: Osaka Steel - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Osaka Steel - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 23.96		vs	   20.62</p>
<p> Operating	    1.42		vs	    1.07</p>
<p> Current		1.51		vs	    1.15</p>
<p> Net		  761    million    vs	  564    million</p>
<p> EPS		   20.04 yen	  vs	   16.10 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     38 million	  vs	  38 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Osaka Steel Co Ltd is a maker of electric furnace shapes.</p>
